# Template sourced by c2p_control_proxy.tcl after floorplan/track/RC setup.
#
# Copy this file outside the repository, replace every placeholder using the
# foundry macro LEF/Liberty data, then set C2P_PPA_MACRO_SETUP_TCL to that
# copy.  It deliberately contains no guessed coordinates, pin names, or PDN
# rules: those would make a physical result look reproducible while being
# physically false.
#
# Expected macro instances in c2p_snapshot_store are copy0..copy3.  Give each
# a legal location/orientation using the implementation's instance names, for
# example:
#   place_instance <hierarchical-copy0-instance> <x_um> <y_um> R0
# and repeat for all four replicas.  Then add their halo/blockages and connect
# the macro VDD/VSS pins to the top-level PDN according to the macro datasheet.
#
# This fragment runs before tapcell/PDN generation, so fixed macros and their
# keepouts are visible to both.  The top-level runner also requires:
#   C2P_PPA_EXTRA_LEF=/path/to/snapshot.lef
#   C2P_PPA_EXTRA_LIBERTY=/path/to/snapshot.lib
# and c2p_snapshot_sram_1r1w's implementation Verilog in C2P_PPA_RTL_FILES.
